ts 8 grids, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 26% of normal in October to November and 28% in November to December. July to August is the wettest pair at 15.95 inches normal, and November to December the driest at 3.81. Grid 8291 had its driest year in 2007 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
